'''Mega Menace''' (ギガガガ強襲, ''Gigagaga Kyōshū'', '''Gigagaga's Assault''') is an event added in [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, progress made in Mega Menace will reset when the event ends, allowing the player to collect the rewards again once the event returns. The boss of this Gauntlet is [[Mega-Mooth]], a variant of [[Mooth]] with much higher stats and long-reaching Omni Strikes.

==Overview==
===About===
Mega Menace contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''On Mighty Wings Lvs'''. After beating three On Mighty Wings Lvs, the player must wait for 30 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (may have 3 clears after 90 minutes). Rewards for the first completion of an On Mighty Wings Lv can include XP, [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Gamatoto Expedition|Catamins]] and [[Ototo Corps|Materials]]. Every 10 On Mighty Wings Lvs plays out the same, but the strength magnifications and enemy base's HP are increased with each level.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Mega Menace/On Mighty Wings Lv1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Mega Menace is unlocked after clearing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

